      "text": "Cholestyramine:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " start one packet or scoopful once or twice a day; maintenance 2 to 4 packets or scoopfuls (8 to 16 g) a day."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
